{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18030","headline":"感春五首 二 · 韩愈","name":"感春五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳东风几时来，川波岸柳春全廻。\n宫门一锁不复啓，虽有九陌无尘埃。\n策马上桥朝日出，楼阙赤白正崔嵬。\n孤吟屡阕莫与和，寸恨至短谁能裁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}